{"id":45,"titleZh":"大变身的巴赫","titleEn":"Bach Transmogrified","date":"1969-04-27","dateZh":"1969 年 4 月 27 日","concepts":"管弦乐改编、Moog 电子合成器、前卫重构与摇滚跨界","thesis":"巴赫的音乐结构实在太结实——无论是交给百人交响大乐队、电子合成器还是插电摇滚乐队轮番改造，主干依然立得住。","plain":"当年巴赫以高热度登上新闻周刊之际，伯恩斯坦决定用四种截然不同的玩法改造巴赫：先看严谨古老的原版管风琴，再对比斯托科夫斯基式的华丽交响改编、当时红极一时的电子合成器版，乃至现代前卫重组与摇滚乐队版。","scenes":["对同一个《g 小调小赋格》连放三个对照版本：青年管风琴手迈克尔·科恩弹原版，高龄大师斯托科夫斯基亲自客串指挥交响改编版，再由舞台上的 Moog 合成器放出电子音色对比。","小提琴拉过原版《E 大调前奏曲》后，乐团演出前卫派卢卡斯·福斯改写的《Phorion》（包含乐手无声按弦、萨克斯乱入和砸碎麻袋里的瓶子），压轴让纽约摇滚乐团直接把《第五勃兰登堡》弹成摇滚版。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1ia4y1a7bR","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ia4y1a7bR","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 变形的巴赫","duration":"51:47","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/bach-transmogrified","repertoire":[{"composer":"J. S. Bach","piece":"Fugue in G Minor, BWV 578 (Little, Organ Original)","titleZh":"g 小调小赋格（管风琴原版）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=J.%20S.%20Bach%20Fugue%20in%20G%20Minor%2C%20BWV%20578+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=J.%20S.%20Bach%20Fugue%20in%20G%20Minor%2C%20BWV%20578"},{"composer":"J. S. Bach / Stokowski","piece":"Fugue in G Minor (Orchestral Transcription)","titleZh":"g 小调小赋格（斯托科夫斯基改编）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=J.%20S.%20Bach%20/%20Stokowski%20Fugue%20in%20G%20Minor+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=J.%20S.%20Bach%20/%20Stokowski%20Fugue%20in%20G%20Minor"},{"composer":"J. S. Bach / Walter Sear","piece":"Fugue in G Minor (Moog Synthesizer)","titleZh":"g 小调小赋格（Moog 电子合成器）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=J.%20S.%20